{"symbol":"WAAREEENER","yahoo":"WAAREEENER.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE377N01017","name":"Waaree Energies Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Solar","website":"https://waaree.com","about":"Waaree Energies Limited manufactures and trades in solar photovoltaic modules in India and internationally. It operates through Solar Photovoltaic Modules; Generation of Power; and Engineering, Procurement and Construction Contract segments. The company offers PV modules, such as HJT, N Type, mono PERC, flexible, and special modules; single and three phase on-grid inverter; solar kits; battery energy storage system; electrolyzer stacks; smart meter; transformer; and Waaree lights. It also provides engineering, procurement, and construction services; asset management; and solar systems for emerging, hybrid, and niche formats, including tracker-integrated systems, agrovoltaics, BIPV, and repowering legacy plants. The company serves engineering, procurement and construction companies; power production companies; power generation utilities; and individual consumers. The company was founded in 1989 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-25T13:48:56+00:00","quote":{"price":2495.0,"prevClose":2482.0,"marketCap":71769.0,"high52":3718.8,"low52":2403.0,"pe":19.07,"bookValue":502.2,"dividendRate":4.0,"roe":null,"shares":28.7651,"insiders":68.15,"institutions":9.01},"prices":{"dates":["2024-10-28","2024-10-29","2024-10-30","2024-10-31","2024-11-01","2024-11-04","2024-11-05","2024-11-06","2024-11-07","2024-11-08","2024-11-11","2024-11-12","2024-11-13","2024-11-14","2024-11-18","2024-11-19","2024-11-21","2024-11-22","2024-11-25","2024-11-26","2024-11-27","2024-11-28","2024-11-29","2024-12-02","2024-12-03","2024-12-04","2024-12-05","2024-12-06","2024-12-09","2024-12-10","2024-12-11","2024-12-12","2024-12-13","2024-12-16","2024-12-17","2024-12-18","2024-12-19","2024-12-20","2024-12-23","2024-12-24","2024-12-26","2024-12-27","2024-12-30","2024-12-31","2025-01-01","2025-01-02","202